  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chibuto-Pambarra-Inchope and MOZI feasibility studies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility study for backbone part 2 / Temane Expansion Project / STE 2 (Chibuto-Pambarra-Inchope, and Mozambique-Zimbabwe Interconnector). Transmission net in the region, including the Mozambique-Malawi interconnector and the Temane Transmission Project. The next step is to connect the Temane power plant to Norfund (Globeleq) together with the northern power grid and the Cahora Bassa dam, through part 2 of EDM&apos;s Backbone Line.</narrative>
  </description>
